WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.400
If you take iron supplements or a multivitamin that contains iron, please stop

2
00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:04.960
taking them

3
00:00:04.960 --> 00:00:09.440
about one week before your procedure. Iron can interfere with your bowel prep

4
00:00:09.440 --> 00:00:10.240
and make it harder

5
00:00:10.240 --> 00:00:15.300
to see clearly during the colonoscopy. Check your multivitamin label too, as

6
00:00:15.300 --> 00:00:16.560
many contain iron,

7
00:00:16.560 --> 00:00:21.220
even if it's not obvious. If you're unsure whether a specific supplement is

8
00:00:21.220 --> 00:00:22.720
okay to continue,

9
00:00:22.720 --> 00:00:25.840
reach out to your doctor's office before making any changes.
